<details class='sub-section' id='sub_0' open><summary class='sub-header'><span><span class='arrow-icon'>▶</span>01 · ON²（面向前方路径）：克服停顿持续进行与坚持推进 <span style='font-weight:400;font-size:0.86em;color:#cbd5e1;margin-left:8px;'>ON²: Continuation along a Path — EPE Ch.3 §3, §8 & §10</span></span><span class='sub-meta'>107 义项</span></summary><div class='epe-explain-box'>📖 <b>EPE 认知机制 (Lindstromberg Ch.3 §1, §3, §8.1 & §10)：</b>EPE 将 ON 严格拆分为两个截然不同的词：这里的 <b>ON²（与 BACK 相对）代表「面向前方、沿着已经开启的路径继续前进」</b>！书中 §8.1 精彩指出：<i>sped/carry/go on</i> 往往暗示<b>此前曾遇到停顿、干扰或阻碍，但依然决定继续向前推进</b>（<i>go/carry/keep/hold/hang/press/drag on</i>）。</div><table><tr><th width='21%'>Phrasal Verb • 语法与语域</th><th width='24%'>🎯 English Definition (WordNet)</th><th width='14%'>🔄 Single-Word Verb</th><th width='41%'>💬 Authentic Examples</th></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive' data-reg='Neutral'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>go <span class='pt-highlight'>on</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 4 个核心义项'>1/4</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物 (Intransitive)</span><span class='reg-Neutral' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库日常/小说会话分布活跃' style='cursor:help;'>⚖️ 通用/中性 (Neutral)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>come to pass</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>hap</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>①</span>What is happening?</div></div>
<div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>②</span>The meeting took place off without an incidence.</div></div>
<div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>③</span>Nothing occurred that seemed important.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive' data-reg='Informal'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>go <span class='pt-highlight'>on</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 4 个核心义项'>2/4</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物 (Intransitive)</span><span class='reg-Informal' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库日常/小说会话分布活跃 + 作为正式词 [continue] 的日常短语替身' style='cursor:help;'>💬 口语/日常 (Informal)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>continue talking;  he continued,</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>continue, proceed</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>①</span>I know it's hard,.</div></div>
<div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>②</span>But there is no choice.</div></div>
<div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>③</span>Carry on--pretend we are not in the room.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive' data-reg='Informal'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>go <span class='pt-highlight'>on</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 4 个核心义项'>3/4</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物 (Intransitive)</span><span class='reg-Informal' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库日常/小说会话分布活跃 + 作为正式词 [advance] 的日常短语替身' style='cursor:help;'>💬 口语/日常 (Informal)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>move forward, also in the metaphorical sense</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>advance, progress</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>📌</span>Time marches on.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable' data-reg='Neutral'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>work <span class='pt-highlight'>on</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 2 个核心义项'>1/2</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span><span class='reg-Neutral' title='🤖 自动判定依据：标准通用语域 (对应: to)' style='cursor:help;'>⚖️ 通用/中性 (Neutral)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>to exert effort in order to do, make, or perform something</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>to</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>📌</span>The child worked at the multiplication table until she had it down cold.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive' data-reg='Neutral'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>be <span class='pt-highlight'>on</span></span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物 (Intransitive)</span><span class='reg-Neutral' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库学术/公文分布比高 (1.659x)' style='cursor:help;'>⚖️ 通用/中性 (Neutral)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>appear in a show, on T.V. or radio</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>air</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>📌</span>The news won't <b>be</b> <b>on</b> tonight.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive' data-reg='Informal'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>come <span class='pt-highlight'>on</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 5 个核心义项'>1/5</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物 (Intransitive)</span><span class='reg-Informal' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库日常/小说会话分布活跃 + 作为正式词 [surface] 的日常短语替身' style='cursor:help;'>💬 口语/日常 (Informal)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>appear or become visible; make a showing</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>surface, appear</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>①</span>She turned up at the funeral.</div></div>
<div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>②</span>I hope the list key is going to surface again.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable' data-reg='Informal'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>get <span class='pt-highlight'>on</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 7 个核心义项'>1/7</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span><span class='reg-Informal' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库日常/小说会话分布活跃 + 作为正式词 [relate] 的日常短语替身' style='cursor:help;'>💬 口语/日常 (Informal)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>have smooth relations</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>relate</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>📌</span>My boss and I get along very well.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive' data-reg='Informal'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>get <span class='pt-highlight'>on</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 7 个核心义项'>2/7</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物 (Intransitive)</span><span class='reg-Informal' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库日常/小说会话分布活跃 + 作为正式词 [progress] 的日常短语替身' style='cursor:help;'>💬 口语/日常 (Informal)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>develop in a positive way</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>progress, advance</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>①</span>He progressed well in school.</div></div>
<div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>②</span>My plants are coming along.</div></div>
<div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>③</span>Plans are shaping up.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive' data-reg='Neutral'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>get <span class='pt-highlight'>on</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 7 个核心义项'>3/7</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物 (Intransitive)</span><span class='reg-Neutral' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库日常/小说会话分布活跃' style='cursor:help;'>⚖️ 通用/中性 (Neutral)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>appear in a show, on T.V. or radio</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>air</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>📌</span>The news won't be on tonight.</div></div></div></td></tr>
