<details class='sub-section' id='sub_1'><summary class='sub-header'><span><span class='arrow-icon'>▶</span>02 · ON¹（接触与支撑）：穿戴、开启运转、登车与承担 <span style='font-weight:400;font-size:0.86em;color:#cbd5e1;margin-left:8px;'>ON¹: Contact, Support & Availability — EPE Ch.3 §2 & §9.2.1</span></span><span class='sub-meta'>34 义项</span></summary><div class='epe-explain-box'>📖 <b>EPE 认知机制 (Lindstromberg Ch.3 §2, §9.2.1 & Ch.4 §3.3)：</b>这里的 <b>ON¹（与 OFF 相对）代表「接触并受表面支撑」</b>：① 衣物接触身体表面即为穿戴（<i>put/try/slip/have on</i>）；② 大型交通工具被视为可行走的平台（<i>get on a bus/train/plane</i>）；③ 开关触点接触代表设备处于通电可用状态（<i>turn/switch/log on</i>）；④ 把重任放到自己肩上支撑即为承担或雇佣（<i>take on</i>）。</div><table><tr><th width='21%'>Phrasal Verb • 语法与语域</th><th width='24%'>🎯 English Definition (WordNet)</th><th width='14%'>🔄 Single-Word Verb</th><th width='41%'>💬 Authentic Examples</th></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable' data-reg='Informal'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>take <span class='pt-highlight'>on</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 4 个核心义项'>1/4</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span><span class='reg-Informal' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库日常/小说会话分布活跃 + 作为正式词 [assume] 的日常短语替身' style='cursor:help;'>💬 口语/日常 (Informal)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>take on a certain form, attribute, or aspect</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>assume, acquire</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>①</span>His voice took on a sad tone.</div></div>
<div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>②</span>The story took a new turn.</div></div>
<div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>③</span>He adopted an air of superiority.</div></div></div></td></tr>
