<details class='sub-section' id='sub_2'><summary class='sub-header'><span><span class='arrow-icon'>▶</span>03 · ON¹ 基础隐喻 <span style='font-weight:400;font-size:0.86em;color:#cbd5e1;margin-left:8px;'>The Basis Metaphor)：依赖、指望、取决于与基于</span></span><span class='sub-meta'>15 义项</span></summary><div class='epe-explain-box'>📖 <b>EPE 认知机制 (Lindstromberg Ch.3 §9.1.6 'The basis metaphor')：</b>就像雕像矗立在底座（plinth）上、房屋建在地基（foundation）上一样，如果抽走底座，上方事物就会坠落。因此，英语用 ON¹ 表达<b>「将某人或某事视为赖以生存或成功的基石（Basis）」</b>：如依赖指望（<i>count/bank/rely/depend/lean/hinge/ride on</i>）、靠某物维生（<i>live/feed/thrive on</i>）。</div><table><tr><th width='21%'>Phrasal Verb • 语法与语域</th><th width='24%'>🎯 English Definition (WordNet)</th><th width='14%'>🔄 Single-Word Verb</th><th width='41%'>💬 Authentic Examples</th></tr>
