<div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>②</span>You can <b>rely</b> <b>on</b> his discretion.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable' data-reg='Formal'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>depend <span class='pt-highlight'>on</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 3 个核心义项'>2/3</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span><span class='reg-Formal' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库学术/公文分布比高 (3.488x) + 拉丁/法语学术词根 [depend]' style='cursor:help;'>🏛️ 正式/书面 (Formal)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>be dependent on, as for support or maintenance</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>be</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>📌</span>Elderly parents often <b>depend</b> <b>on</b> their adult children.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable' data-reg='Formal'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>depend <span class='pt-highlight'>on</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 3 个核心义项'>3/3</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span><span class='reg-Formal' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库学术/公文分布比高 (3.488x) + 拉丁/法语学术词根 [depend]' style='cursor:help;'>🏛️ 正式/书面 (Formal)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>put trust in with confidence</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>put</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>①</span>She is someone you can really rely on when times get rough.</div></div>
